  "comments": [
    "[decision] CreateClient has no create-once guard: no spec covers a repeated CreateClient on the same clientId, so a second POST appends another ClientCreated. Add a spec if duplicates must be rejected.",
    "[limitation] No behavioral tests: this UI stack has no test runner; specs are covered by rendering backend 409 messages inline (samples 2/3 exercise the invalid inputs).",
    "[decision] Email validity is a pragmatic local@domain.tld regex check; name is rejected when blank after trimming."
  ]
